+<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN">
+<html><head>
+<!--
+Tests for the OpenGL ES 2.0 HTML Canvas context
+
+Copyright (C) 2009  Ilmari Heikkinen <ilmari.heikkinen@gmail.com>
+
